OL,3,AKennedys sue to block Trump's arch,
OL,4,Aarguing it would cast shadow on JFK's
OL,5,Agrave
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of former US President John
OL,8,FF Kennedy has sued to block
OL,9,Fconstruction of a triumphal arch that
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump plans to build
OL,11,Fin the nation's capital.
OL,13,FNine members of the political dynasty
OL,14,Fargue the 250ft (76m) structure would
OL,15,Fblock the view of Kennedy's grave, as
OL,16,Fwell as the graves of thousands of
OL,17,Fveterans buried at Arlington National
OL,18,FCemetery in Virginia.
OL,20,FLast week, a US judge temporarily
OL,21,Fhalted the project on the heels of a
OL,22,Fvote allowing construction to proceed.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
