OL,3,AKennedys sue to block Trump's arch,
OL,4,Aarguing it would cast shadow on JFK's
OL,5,Agrave
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe White House said it was
OL,8,F"unfortunate" to see that some members
OL,9,Fof the Kennedy family had joined
OL,10,Flitigation against an arch "intended to
OL,11,Fhonor our heroes who rest in Arlington
OL,12,FCemetery".
